   "With #3222's harness (`docs/spikes/3222/harness.mjs`), in each of its 1, 4 and 16-session runs, the median service of the last 20 calls is at most 1.25 times the first 20's (drafted; 1.7, 3.2 and 100 times on main). The harness's output on the merge base is kept beside it",
   "In #3222's planted slow call's runs (`--sessions 15 --patches`, with and without `--slow`), the 15 patches' median service with the slow call in flight is at most 1.25 times their median with none (drafted; 434 ms against 88 ms on main). A planted canvas side that keeps render-backs fails, naming the render-back",
   "Every reply equals the reply of a fresh hub that plays every kept call, on the scenarios #806's, #393's, #384's, #1415's and #2694's suites play and on #3222's 16-session script. A planted canvas side that keeps its hub across a world change that ended a session fails, naming the first call whose reply differs"
